    # "We walk until the sun begins to set and it's time to set up camp once again."
    "Güneş batmaya başlayana kadar yürürüz ve yine kamp kurma vakti gelir."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene7d.rpy:24
translate turkish u19a2s7d_1aaf425d:

    # "We chat around the fire at night until we're both tired and it's time to sleep."
    "Geceleyin ateşin etrafında, ikimiz de yorulana ve uyku vakti gelene kadar sohbet ederiz."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene7d.rpy:25
